{"id": "DcY2dNYyjPh", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"APPLE\" to get this Claude skill to design like Apple.\n\nYou can now create Apple level websites with Claude using this one skill.\n\nSomeone on GitHub just compressed years of Apple's design thinking into a single skill.\n\nThe exact colors, fonts, motion, and rules they use across their every product.\n\nWith it, you can create premium animated websites like these.\n\nOr use it to fix your existing projects instead.\n\nNow to install it, just copy these commands into your Claude Code terminal.\n\nThen ask it to review your site.\n\nIn a couple of minutes, it comes back with every minor thing that's off.\n\nBased on Apple's own design guidelines.\n\nPlus the exact fixes for each one.\n\nThink of it like having Apple's design team quietly reviewing your work in the background.\n\nNo more guessing whether your spacing, motion, or typography actually feels premium.\n\nThe skill just tells you, and shows you exactly how to fix it.\n\n#claudeai #claudecode #appledesign #claudeskills #animatedwebsites", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1787500352, "like_count": 3460, "comment_count": 6843, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1099066455886183a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.08, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN0ug2PxqV_5K5GNEiguyr1MvHGySkF6-0RG9fxPaeq-JiQeR2knGJMtA1LB598EawUpDJLg0j4GJ0h8FJJxGzFZ_5nCprmxngi0cI.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adqenq_dhWqN5dMWrYalCYMA3ZRjD2AIWQJo_x_rk4Ao2YeoqnzmjcGyJdgvkKLQ9fQ&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Xif1NJy8xh4Q7kNvwF5EZxZ&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Lta7ckiIsqXCIGnp3dHmJQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSKxbRRfrwoc8vlLcsBCazifDd3WPSI05KqiiSks3_fNg&oe=6AE6051C"